134 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 308 0 R
/E (TF-IDF vs. BM25: Surprisingly, TF-IDF outperformed BM25 across all combinations. Files in the Highwire corpus have the same structure, and since the length difference between the documents is not significant, the b parameter is not effective. The k1 parameter saturates medical terms, meaning that even if they appear more frequently after a certain point, they do not increase the score. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [87]
>>
endobj
135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 309 0 R
/E (Negative Effect of MeSH: The users of this system already have a sufficient level of knowledge to write good queries. MeSH causes topic drift.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [88]
>>
endobj
136 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
